{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05504","headline":"戏赠姚侍御 · 丁仙芝","name":"戏赠姚侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"繁霜晓幕鸣柏乌，待子兽炭然金炉。\n重门启锁紫髯胡，新披骢马陇西驹。\n头戴獬豸急晨趋，明光殿前见天子，今日应弹佞幸夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁仙芝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05504.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05504","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}